WEBVTT

00:00:06.421 --> 00:00:09.390
Disgaea

00:00:10.225 --> 00:00:15.686
Ai no tameiki ni
shibarareteru mitai.

00:00:15.797 --> 00:00:20.757
Donna jumon de mo
hodokenai no yo.

00:00:23.071 --> 00:00:28.475
Urei wo hisometa
shizuka na hitomi ga...

00:00:28.577 --> 00:00:33.708
...yokei ni kokoro
kakimidashiteku.

00:00:35.951 --> 00:00:42.254
Sunao ja nai watashi
yori motto...

00:00:42.357 --> 00:00:48.489
...sunao ja nai anata
ga itoshii.

00:00:48.597 --> 00:00:54.661
Anata ga ii no,
akuma de mo ii.

00:00:55.237 --> 00:01:01.369
Ah, ima meguriaeta kiseki.

00:01:01.509 --> 00:01:07.880
Kienai kizu mo,
fukai karuma mo.

00:01:07.983 --> 00:01:11.214
Ah aishitageru,

00:01:11.419 --> 00:01:13.717
doko ni ite mo
nando demo.

00:01:19.661 --> 00:01:22.357
Aishitageru.

00:01:43.318 --> 00:01:44.945
Yuie flowers?

00:01:45.053 --> 00:01:51.014
Love... After the Fighting's Over

00:01:56.097 --> 00:02:00.659
Laharl! Etna! We've arrived!
We made it to Celestia!

00:02:00.769 --> 00:02:04.569
This is Celestia?
It's bright!

00:02:04.973 --> 00:02:08.773
Look, these are the Yuie flowers
that I love so much!

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:11.940
And over there is the
Seraphic Sanctuary.

00:02:13.682 --> 00:02:16.549
Yikes, that place is kinda
tacky, huh, Highness?

00:02:16.851 --> 00:02:18.910
And that "Seraph" of yours
is in there?

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:19.884
Right.

00:02:19.988 --> 00:02:24.118
Good, then the time has finally come to
settle things with Celestia once and for all.

00:02:24.259 --> 00:02:28.821
First the Netherworld, then the human world!
And now Celestia will belong to me, too!

00:02:40.241 --> 00:02:42.038
Who the heck are
these guys?

00:02:43.445 --> 00:02:47.609
They're Angel Soldiers. Ones that are under
the direct command of a high-ranking angel...

00:02:48.149 --> 00:02:51.482
So, that means that they're the goon squad
of that "Seraph Lamington" of yours?

00:02:51.586 --> 00:02:53.076
I don't like the look
of these guys.

00:02:53.188 --> 00:02:54.815
No, I can't
believe that...

00:02:55.623 --> 00:03:00.560
An extermination order has been issued
for the rebel Flonne and her cohorts!

00:03:00.995 --> 00:03:04.192
Hear that, Highness?
He says we're her "cohorts."

00:03:04.499 --> 00:03:07.127
These angels are awfully uppity,
aren't they?

00:03:07.235 --> 00:03:09.760
Just a minute! There's been
some kind of misunderstanding!

00:03:09.871 --> 00:03:11.566
This is despicable,
Flonne.

00:03:14.476 --> 00:03:15.841
Master Vulcanus...

00:03:16.177 --> 00:03:20.011
Wait, this guy is an angel?
That mug has "villain" written all over it!

00:03:20.949 --> 00:03:25.113
Flonne! In the Netherworld,
you harmed an innocent angel warrior!

00:03:25.353 --> 00:03:28.379
That alone is a crime
which warrants death!

00:03:28.957 --> 00:03:32.825
Wait a minute. How, exactly,
do you know about that?

00:03:33.762 --> 00:03:37.357
Hey, don't tell me that he's the "man with
white wings" that old guy mentioned!

00:03:37.799 --> 00:03:40.825
So, you were the one who manipulated
those Defenders of Earth,

00:03:40.935 --> 00:03:42.766
and who attacked
my Netherworld?

00:03:43.838 --> 00:03:45.271
Master Vulcanus...

00:03:46.341 --> 00:03:49.310
I did not attack you.
I merely guided the humans.

00:03:49.444 --> 00:03:50.411
What?!

00:03:50.545 --> 00:03:55.209
Our role as angels is to wipe out demons,
who are the root of all evil,

00:03:55.316 --> 00:03:57.750
and to guide along the
helpless human race.

00:03:58.052 --> 00:04:01.317
All I did was quietly help
that cause along a little.

00:04:01.823 --> 00:04:05.657
But as for you, Flonne... You have
renounced your proper duties,

00:04:05.794 --> 00:04:08.126
and continue to conspire
with these vile demons!

00:04:08.229 --> 00:04:10.220
You are attempting to
take over Celestia!

00:04:10.331 --> 00:04:13.562
What would you have me call that,
if not rebellion?!

00:04:14.102 --> 00:04:17.629
Geez, Highness, doesn't this guy
piss you off?

00:04:19.107 --> 00:04:21.803
Just who the hell do you think you are,
you bastard?!

00:04:23.178 --> 00:04:28.206
Laharl! Please, I beg of you.
Let me handle this.

00:04:28.716 --> 00:04:30.308
Very well.

00:04:31.886 --> 00:04:35.788
Master Vulcanus.
I pity you.

00:04:37.358 --> 00:04:41.727
You've convinced yourself that demons
are evil and humans are powerless,

00:04:41.863 --> 00:04:44.195
and believe that only you
are right.

00:04:44.332 --> 00:04:47.130
But I learned something
in the Netherworld.

00:04:47.235 --> 00:04:49.795
I learned that there are demons
with wonderful hearts,

00:04:50.138 --> 00:04:52.606
as well as humans who
are full of courage.

00:04:52.974 --> 00:04:58.071
But you, you go on with your prejudiced
thinking, completely oblivious to that fact!

00:04:58.346 --> 00:04:59.711
I feel sorry for you!

00:05:01.683 --> 00:05:07.019
Isn't the evil that you speak of actually
in your own heart, Master Vulcanus?

00:05:07.455 --> 00:05:09.423
You have the nerve
to call me evil?

00:05:09.524 --> 00:05:11.890
Such impudence from
a mere Angel Trainee!

00:05:12.227 --> 00:05:15.492
Very well, I see that I shall have to prove
to you that what I am doing is right!

00:05:39.954 --> 00:05:40.545
What the?

00:05:40.655 --> 00:05:42.885
Hey, these are
greater demons!

00:05:44.125 --> 00:05:47.959
I thought something like this might happen,
so I made a pact with them, just in case!

00:05:48.129 --> 00:05:51.895
Entering into pacts with demons is
supposed to be strictly forbidden!

00:05:52.433 --> 00:05:55.231
When I said I'd give them the Netherworld
if they defeated the Overlord for me,

00:05:55.336 --> 00:05:57.531
they agreed to the
pact immediately.

00:05:57.672 --> 00:06:01.802
See, Highness? This is what happens
when you're unpopular!

00:06:01.943 --> 00:06:04.275
Oh, shut up!
This is hardly the time!

00:06:20.628 --> 00:06:23.324
Please, stop!
You're trampling the Yuie flowers!

00:06:27.702 --> 00:06:32.036
You let an angel use you as his flunkies...
You're not fit to be called demons!

00:06:32.173 --> 00:06:33.140
Get lost!

00:06:33.274 --> 00:06:35.572
No, Laharl, you mustn't!
Here in Celestia, we...

00:06:40.148 --> 00:06:44.414
I knew it, they were all bark and no bite.
They're ruining the Netherworld's good name.

00:06:44.519 --> 00:06:46.077
Now it's your turn.

00:06:48.122 --> 00:06:49.316
Master Vulcanus!

00:06:49.557 --> 00:06:52.219
Your boss sure knows how
to beat a hasty retreat.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:59.889
I'm not Master Vulcanus' vassal.
I serve Seraph Lamington, and him alone.

00:07:00.368 --> 00:07:02.359
Well, not that it makes
any difference...

00:07:02.704 --> 00:07:06.071
I'm sure that Master Vulcanus
did all this on his own.

00:07:06.174 --> 00:07:07.869
But why?

00:07:07.976 --> 00:07:10.342
I can't believe that Seraph Lamington
could be unaware of this...

00:07:10.845 --> 00:07:15.282
If he was, you'd think that he
would've come to help you.

00:07:16.184 --> 00:07:19.984
You don't suppose that those two
are working in cahoots, do ya?

00:07:20.121 --> 00:07:21.816
That's flat-out impossible!

00:07:21.923 --> 00:07:25.051
I'm sure that this will all be straightened out
once we see Seraph Lamington!

00:07:25.193 --> 00:07:25.989
If you say so.

00:07:26.094 --> 00:07:32.090
Yeah, whatever. But don't you ever forget
that you're MY vassal, got it?

00:07:33.234 --> 00:07:34.724
Now, take me to
the sanctuary!

00:07:35.103 --> 00:07:36.092
Sure.

00:07:52.086 --> 00:07:54.953
Seraph, t-there's an emergency!

00:07:55.189 --> 00:07:59.057
A horde of demons is bearing down upon us!
Please, call up the sanctuary's defenses!

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:01.360
That will not
be necessary.

00:08:01.696 --> 00:08:03.630
Seraph Lamington...

00:08:14.075 --> 00:08:20.014
Up ahead is the inner sanctum of the sanctuary,
the room that we angels call the Sacred Altar.

00:08:20.615 --> 00:08:23.049
He isn't going to try to pull
some cheap trick on us, is he?

00:08:23.284 --> 00:08:25.514
Seraph Lamington would
never do such a thing!

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.184
I bid you welcome
to Celestia.

00:08:53.214 --> 00:08:54.613
Seraph Lamington!

00:08:56.484 --> 00:08:58.509
Flonne, it is good to see
that you are looking well.

00:08:58.619 --> 00:09:01.349
Thank you. It's good to see that you look
as well as ever, Seraph Lamington.

00:09:01.856 --> 00:09:03.289
So, you're the Seraph, huh?

00:09:03.891 --> 00:09:06.655
I have been looking forward to
meeting you, Overlord Laharl.

00:09:06.894 --> 00:09:10.125
T-This demon has come here
to take over Celestia!

00:09:10.231 --> 00:09:12.199
I advise caution, sir!

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:17.067
Just a minute, pal! Remind me who was trying
to destroy the Netherworld a while ago!

00:09:17.171 --> 00:09:18.900
Ah, you must be Etna.

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:23.540
Goodness gracious, I'm famous
even in Celestia!

00:09:24.445 --> 00:09:29.314
From here, I can see everything that transpires
in the Netherworld and in the human world.

00:09:29.417 --> 00:09:32.318
Which means that you know
what your vassal here...

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.547
...was doing down in
the Netherworld?

00:09:35.056 --> 00:09:37.286
Please tell me,
Seraph Lamington...

00:09:37.759 --> 00:09:44.164
Did you know that Master Vulcanus instigated
the humans into attacking the Netherworld?

00:09:44.732 --> 00:09:50.136
If you DID know, why did you do nothing
to stop Master Vulcanus' actions?

00:09:50.238 --> 00:09:52.399
You go too far,
Flonne!

00:09:52.974 --> 00:09:57.502
Seraph, there is no reason to pay
any heed to anything that she says.

00:09:57.645 --> 00:09:59.476
Keep your mouth shut, you!

00:09:59.747 --> 00:10:04.684
Master Vulcanus has said that demons
are evil and that humans are helpless.

00:10:05.086 --> 00:10:08.180
But I don't believe that
to be the case at all.

00:10:08.689 --> 00:10:10.350
Would you shut up?!

00:10:10.458 --> 00:10:12.688
Flonne. What you say
is correct.

00:10:13.561 --> 00:10:18.191
Those who dwell in Celestia now
have indeed blinded themselves.

00:10:18.533 --> 00:10:20.728
They have convinced themselves
that they represent absolute good,

00:10:20.835 --> 00:10:26.205
and that the demons, those who live
differently than they do, are absolute evil.

00:10:26.841 --> 00:10:29.708
However, those are
prejudiced views.

00:10:30.344 --> 00:10:35.304
Perhaps Vulcanus took the actions he did
as a result of that prejudice.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.308
Seraph Lamington...

00:10:37.685 --> 00:10:42.213
I knew full well what you were up to.
But I did nothing to stop you.

00:10:43.324 --> 00:10:46.427
I did nothing because I believed
this to be an ordeal...

00:10:46.427 --> 00:10:48.793
...that was necessary for both
demons and humans alike.

00:10:49.297 --> 00:10:51.231
My thought was that for Celestia,
the Netherworld, and the human world...

00:10:51.332 --> 00:10:55.132
...to understand one another
and meet the future hand in hand,

00:10:55.236 --> 00:10:58.034
it would be necessary for us all
to experience a shared pain.

00:10:58.606 --> 00:11:00.733
An "ordeal," huh?!
What a load of garbage!

00:11:00.875 --> 00:11:03.901
You were just getting your jollies by sitting back
and watching the show from a safe distance!

00:11:04.045 --> 00:11:07.845
He's right! What's up with you angels
playing way dirtier than any demon?

00:11:07.949 --> 00:11:11.544
I do, of course, intend to make
Vulcanus atone for his actions.

00:11:11.986 --> 00:11:14.784
Wha?
Surely you don't mean...

00:11:20.127 --> 00:11:21.924
Uh-oh. What's with
the laughing?

00:11:22.029 --> 00:11:25.556
Now I see.
It's all clear to me now, Seraph.

00:11:25.833 --> 00:11:30.770
These demons have used Flonne
to take control of your mind.

00:11:31.839 --> 00:11:34.933
Aw, man,
he's totally lost it!

00:11:35.176 --> 00:11:38.009
You are no longer fit
to rule Celestia!

00:11:38.479 --> 00:11:41.448
Leave this to me, Vulcanus...

00:11:46.988 --> 00:11:48.888
Disgaea

00:11:49.891 --> 00:11:55.955
Disgaea

00:12:00.101 --> 00:12:02.296
Laharl, please!
You have to stop him!

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.832
Domestic squabbles between angels
are no concern of mine.

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:07.771
Lamington,
say your prayers!

00:12:17.685 --> 00:12:19.676
W-What?!

00:12:25.526 --> 00:12:27.050
A frog?!

00:12:27.428 --> 00:12:30.329
This is the punishment I have
meted out to Vulcanus.

00:12:30.531 --> 00:12:34.991
He must learn discipline in that form
for the next thousand years.

00:12:36.704 --> 00:12:37.636
That's awesome!

00:12:37.738 --> 00:12:41.731
You wouldn't expect punishment from angels to
be this harsh and funny, would ya, Highness?

00:12:42.443 --> 00:12:43.603
Huh?

00:12:44.679 --> 00:12:47.079
I don't like this
one bit.

00:12:48.683 --> 00:12:52.244
You spout your high and mighty garbage
about punishment and atonement,

00:12:52.653 --> 00:12:56.714
but the truth is, you just got rid of the guy
because he was trying to kill you!

00:12:56.924 --> 00:12:59.415
Laharl, why are you
saying such things?

00:13:00.561 --> 00:13:05.123
In the first place, weren't YOU were the one
who ordered Flonne to kill my old man?

00:13:05.933 --> 00:13:08.663
Wasn't it really YOU who was trying
to conquer the Netherworld...

00:13:08.769 --> 00:13:10.794
...and become ruler of
the whole universe?

00:13:11.305 --> 00:13:15.105
My intent was to bring peace
to the Netherworld.

00:13:15.509 --> 00:13:16.771
What?!

00:13:16.877 --> 00:13:21.678
I had learned that your father,
King Krichevskoy, had passed away.

00:13:21.916 --> 00:13:28.116
Afterwards, the Netherworld became the scene
of unending fighting over the throne.

00:13:28.823 --> 00:13:31.758
It occurred to me that to restore the
Netherworld to its former state,

00:13:31.859 --> 00:13:35.659
I would need your strength, but you
were in a poison-induced sleep.

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:40.126
And so, I dispatched Flonne
to have her awaken you.

00:13:40.568 --> 00:13:44.129
What, really?
Flonne, did you know about this?

00:13:44.505 --> 00:13:46.097
This is the first
I heard of it.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:51.141
Hey, wait a minute! I conquered
the Netherworld to serve my OWN ends!

00:13:51.479 --> 00:13:53.140
I didn't do it
for you people!

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.770
You have done well,
Flonne.

00:13:55.683 --> 00:13:56.980
Pay attention when
I'm talking!

00:13:57.485 --> 00:14:00.352
Wow, this guy lives in his own little world
even more than the Prince does...

00:14:00.454 --> 00:14:03.287
But why would you give me
a mission like that?

00:14:03.657 --> 00:14:04.851
Because of love.

00:14:05.493 --> 00:14:06.653
Love?

00:14:07.094 --> 00:14:10.621
My goal is not simply to bring
peace to the Netherworld,

00:14:10.965 --> 00:14:15.095
but rather to unite the Netherworld, Celestia,
and the human world in love.

00:14:15.636 --> 00:14:18.503
Whoa, there's the "L" word!
He's the president of the Love Freak Club!

00:14:18.639 --> 00:14:24.134
To accomplish this, it was necessary for both
you and Overlord Laharl to learn about love.

00:14:24.612 --> 00:14:29.606
Thanks for nothing! Do you have any idea
what kinds of crap you put us...

00:14:29.717 --> 00:14:36.418
Although those battles were not my true intent,
I have nevertheless harmed you as a result.

00:14:36.791 --> 00:14:38.918
I must accept responsibility
for that.

00:14:39.126 --> 00:14:40.855
Thanks for stating
the obvious!

00:14:41.228 --> 00:14:44.220
But before that...
Angel Trainee Flonne.

00:14:44.331 --> 00:14:45.161
Yes, sir.

00:14:45.266 --> 00:14:46.927
By completing your mission
in the Netherworld...

00:14:47.034 --> 00:14:50.333
...and foiling Vulcanus' plans, you have
rendered a great service to Celestia.

00:14:50.471 --> 00:14:53.133
However, your sin of injuring
many angelic warriors,

00:14:53.307 --> 00:14:55.502
fellow denizens of Celestia,
is a grave one.

00:14:56.143 --> 00:14:59.237
And for that sin,
you must be punished.

00:15:00.514 --> 00:15:02.778
Yes, sir. I'm prepared to
accept my punishment.

00:15:02.917 --> 00:15:06.683
Hey! What's the meaning of this?!
Why does SHE have to be punished?!

00:15:07.188 --> 00:15:10.316
If you do anything to Flonne,
you're gonna regret it!

00:15:10.691 --> 00:15:14.183
It's all right. I knew
that this would happen.

00:15:22.002 --> 00:15:24.994
Seraph Lamington,
I have one last request.

00:15:25.439 --> 00:15:30.069
Please overlook any sins that may have
been committed by Laharl and Etna here.

00:15:30.511 --> 00:15:33.446
Anything they did,
they only did because of me.

00:15:33.547 --> 00:15:35.481
Flonne, what are you
trying to...

00:15:35.816 --> 00:15:40.219
What are you talking about?!
You haven't done anything wrong!

00:15:40.321 --> 00:15:41.515
Very well.

00:15:41.622 --> 00:15:42.919
Thank you, sir.

00:15:45.126 --> 00:15:46.525
Don't!

00:15:53.434 --> 00:15:54.458
Flonne...

00:15:55.369 --> 00:16:00.636
I'm sorry, Laharl. I was completely
useless as a vassal, wasn't I?

00:16:02.209 --> 00:16:05.440
But I wasn't wrong
to have faith in you.

00:16:05.546 --> 00:16:09.573
Flonne, you're a
hopeless fool.

00:16:10.284 --> 00:16:14.550
It was you who taught me
that demons feel love, too.

00:16:14.655 --> 00:16:19.558
I don't know what you're talking about!
Come on, let's go back to the Netherworld!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.460
Laharl, would you mind
taking my pendant for me?

00:16:24.899 --> 00:16:27.299
Highness, if you touch that,
it'll burn you again!

00:16:42.616 --> 00:16:43.844
Highness?

00:16:44.985 --> 00:16:50.355
Goodbye, Laharl, Etna.
Thank you for everything you've done for me.

00:17:05.739 --> 00:17:09.231
Angel Trainee Flonne's sins
have now been erased.

00:17:09.343 --> 00:17:13.109
This is horrible...
This is how you angels do things?

00:17:13.581 --> 00:17:15.742
I'll never forgive you
for what you did to her!

00:17:16.283 --> 00:17:19.741
Overlord Laharl, do you
despise me as well?

00:17:21.255 --> 00:17:22.916
Despise you?

00:17:23.524 --> 00:17:24.991
How can you...

00:17:25.526 --> 00:17:29.826
How can you even ask me
that question?!

00:17:38.839 --> 00:17:41.239
Who cares about love?!
Who cares about justice?!

00:17:41.342 --> 00:17:44.834
You people and your rules
can kiss my ass!

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:54.715
What pisses me off more than anything else
is that phony smile on your face!

00:18:04.265 --> 00:18:09.862
And this is MY punishment for forcing you
to undergo those trials. I humbly accept it.

00:18:26.687 --> 00:18:27.813
Highness!

00:18:32.192 --> 00:18:32.954
Screw this.

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:34.118
Highness?

00:18:34.228 --> 00:18:37.994
Killing him now wouldn't change anything.
And besides...

00:18:39.233 --> 00:18:42.498
If the Love Freak were here,
she probably would've stopped me.

00:18:42.636 --> 00:18:43.967
Highness...

00:18:44.505 --> 00:18:45.767
Flonne...

00:18:47.408 --> 00:18:50.605
<i>Is this the "love" that you've
been going on and on about?</i>

00:18:51.245 --> 00:18:56.182
If this is love, I'll never believe in it!
Not for as long as I live!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:04.489
Etna.

00:19:05.492 --> 00:19:06.925
H-Highness?!

00:19:08.128 --> 00:19:09.595
I don't believe it...

00:19:09.697 --> 00:19:12.165
This is the ending
you will choose?

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.661
It's all yours now.

00:19:14.968 --> 00:19:16.697
You can't do this,
Highness!

00:19:16.804 --> 00:19:18.271
Don't try to stop me!

00:19:24.978 --> 00:19:25.967
Laharl!

00:19:28.582 --> 00:19:29.810
Goodbye!

00:20:35.115 --> 00:20:38.915
You can be sure that there is love in
the heart of each and every demon!

00:20:39.353 --> 00:20:42.288
Come what may,
love always comes first.

00:20:42.523 --> 00:20:46.152
Love that's freely given!
Affectionate love! True love!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:50.492
It is the power of this love that will save
the Netherworld, all worlds everywhere!

00:20:50.597 --> 00:20:53.031
Everybody got that?
'Cause it's gonna be on the test.

00:20:54.001 --> 00:20:56.868
Etna, are you
slacking off again?

00:20:58.238 --> 00:20:59.637
- It's Etna!
- Wow, it's Etna!

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:03.437
How many times do I have to tell you kids?
It's not "Etna," it's "Overlord Etna"!

00:21:03.977 --> 00:21:06.912
Come on, now, if you don't
pay attention in class,

00:21:07.014 --> 00:21:10.211
you're gonna turn into a mean,
nasty ol' demon like her!

00:21:10.317 --> 00:21:11.181
Yes, ma'am!

00:21:11.285 --> 00:21:12.809
Like WHO?

00:21:14.788 --> 00:21:18.884
Oh, wow! Look, it's Gordon
and his sidekicks!

00:21:18.992 --> 00:21:20.254
They look so cool!

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:23.659
If you wanna go see it, I have tickets.
I sure as heck ain't gonna.

00:21:23.764 --> 00:21:27.666
I'll just take the poster, thanks. I bet
the movie itself is gonna be lame.

00:21:28.001 --> 00:21:31.334
You know, you've got a mouth on you
ever since you became a fallen angel.

00:21:31.839 --> 00:21:33.238
Aw, I'm flattered!

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:37.572
Man, being Overlord is one big hassle!
I'm up to my ears in work!

00:21:37.678 --> 00:21:39.441
Lady Etna! Lady Etna!

00:21:39.546 --> 00:21:41.309
What now,
more trouble?

00:21:41.782 --> 00:21:42.908
Lady Etna!

00:21:43.016 --> 00:21:44.813
That's "Overlord Etna,"
damn it!

00:21:45.752 --> 00:21:48.812
W-We've been badly
understaffed lately, Overdood,

00:21:48.922 --> 00:21:52.050
and there's a new Prinny who's causing trouble
because he refuses to work!

00:21:52.426 --> 00:21:54.291
He's what?!

00:21:58.131 --> 00:21:59.223
Over there!

00:21:59.333 --> 00:22:01.665
Hey, new guy!
Quit goofing off!

00:22:01.768 --> 00:22:03.463
Get your feathered fanny
in gear!

00:22:41.041 --> 00:22:48.470
Aoi hiru ga meguru hoshi de
toki no ruupu mezametara,

00:22:48.815 --> 00:22:56.551
chigau kokoro motta mono atsumareba
nanika ga okiru yo.

00:22:56.857 --> 00:23:04.423
Yokubou de umeru no ka?
Ai wa hito no tame ni ugoko no ka?

00:23:04.798 --> 00:23:11.761
Dotchi datte kamawanai yo,
suki ni yaru dake.

00:23:12.439 --> 00:23:20.175
Hikari to kage kono sekai de
subete ga imi aru egoisuto.

00:23:20.314 --> 00:23:27.982
Hitotsu hitotsu no kakera wa
sou baransu wo ninai ikiteru.

00:23:28.088 --> 00:23:39.864
Omou no mama, kokoro no mama ni
ima wa onaji sora no shita...

00:23:39.967 --> 00:23:43.960
...hikari to kage
wa kurikaesu.

00:23:44.871 --> 00:23:49.171
Chain react.
